  "comment": "A Fragment is a piece of an activity which enable more modular activity design. It will not be wrong if we say, a fragment is a kind of sub-activity. Following are important points about fragment − A fragment has its own layout and its own behaviour with its own life cycle callbacks. You can add or remove fragments in an activity while the activity is running. You can combine multiple fragments",
